BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (and evidence, other MDLs already in the district, and the judge's competence. Each side banks something: defendants) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (get manageability, plaintiffs get global-settlement pressure, and courts get a single judge. Justinian & Associates adds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (that drug-injury plaintiffs have no class-action route at all, so the MDL becomes the vehicle, with the plaintiffs' steering) Tj ET
