BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (common benefit fund [sozfq7mjvKE @ 00:09:19]. Plaintiff fact sheets are sworn and carry perjury exposure, courts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (may demand Lone Pine affidavits, late fact sheets can trigger dismissal, and defendant fact sheets come due only after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (the plaintiffs'. Defense trial attorney Kevin Mayer confirms either side can petition for the MDL, after which the judge) Tj ET
