BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 349.77 Tm (The ugliest trap is the inventory nobody vetted. Trial selection in one MDL surfaced a neighbor's video of a plaintiff) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 334.55 Tm (chopping wood and a speedboat-race trophy belonging to plaintiffs who claimed total disability. Once trial-readiness) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 319.32 Tm (certification was imposed, the inventory shrank [vk0M8TfTG9g @ 00:52:08]. David Burnick puts the dead weight at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.10 Tm (roughly 25 to 30 percent of cases that should never have been brought [LVcpWtomEvU @ 01:20:03]. Sullivan &) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 288.87 Tm (Cromwell spells out the cost: unvetted meritless cases inflate settlement numbers and impede negotiations, which is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 273.65 Tm (precisely the problem the MDL Subcommittee formed in 2017 to address [X7eQYHQmnm8 @ 00:03:57]. Even the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 258.42 Tm (plaintiffs' side has tightened up. Chris Seeger now requires a pharmacy record and proof of income before carrying a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.20 Tm (claim, after watching medical-record collection run into the tens of millions [vk0M8TfTG9g @ 00:56:39]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 227.97 Tm (economics check is blunt. A case file that cannot survive a fact-sheet audit is not an asset; it is a liability that drags) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 212.75 Tm (down the per-claim number for every legitimate client in the same grid. Acquisition volume without proof of product) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 197.52 Tm (use, proof of injury, and proof of damages is the fastest way to get an entire docket discounted, delayed, or dismissed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 182.30 Tm (once the defense starts pulling files for trial.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 167.07 Tm (Transaction costs eat recoveries alive. Vioxx settled for $4.85 billion, and Chris Seeger notes that roughly one-third) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 151.85 Tm (went to fees under the retainers. Seeger treats that cost load as the reason to explore settlement early and build trust) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 136.62 Tm ([vk0M8TfTG9g @ 00:17:07]. Trying cases is no cheaper: Vioxx cost more than $40 million to try 18 cases) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 121.40 Tm ([LVcpWtomEvU @ 00:22:27]. David Burnick pegs mass-tort discovery spend at $20 to $40 million and demands) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 106.17 Tm (proportionality [LVcpWtomEvU @ 00:07:28]. At the single-case level, the Center for Litigation and Courts warns that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 90.95 Tm (expert and discovery costs in an individual suit may simply not justify the damages, which is why claimants get pooled) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 75.72 Tm (at all [ZZ-JHbBTjyw @ 00:03:33]. The defense side runs its own math. Burnick credits the testosterone MDL model,) Tj ET
