BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 415.32 Tm (00:00:15]. Alert Communications puts numbers on the conversion gap: firms with broken intake convert 20% to 40%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 400.10 Tm (of leads instead of 70% to 80% [PJEVefyQCxA @ 00:16:47]. Alert's worked example runs a $2,000 cost per) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 384.87 Tm (acquisition built from $500 to $1,750 of marketing and $250 to $500 of intake, with a single lost lead costing up to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 369.65 Tm ($750 [PJEVefyQCxA @ 00:17:17]. The trap that hides this is an undersized funnel: a firm reporting 70 out of 100) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 354.42 Tm (looks healthy while the leads it never captured stay invisible, against an Alert campaign running at 70% qualified that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 339.20 Tm (can reach 80% to 85% [PJEVefyQCxA @ 00:14:18]. K'Lee Terrazas adds the paid-media version of the same loss:) Tj ET
