BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (The retrieval playbook from The New York Injury & Malpractice Law Firm runs on speed, not patience. Portals are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (fast but incomplete, and the statutory 30-day deadline is almost always ignored, so the firm calls the records custodian) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (directly, cites ongoing medical care, and asks for email delivery or sends a courier at a set time, chasing a 24-hour) Tj ET
