BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (move is to narrow the request to the operative or imaging report, roughly 10 to 20 pages instead of 2,000 to 3,000, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (if that fails, subpoena the records, since ignoring a subpoena means contempt; the firm has sued just to get records) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm ([uJITvDxd4jA @ 00:03:40]. The firm's no-expense routine adds a three-page cover letter citing HITECH that refuses) Tj ET
