BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (day, often at no charge, and a $10 Starbucks gift card, then scans the file into case-management software and burns) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (CDs for experts [JdDeicrkI-o @ 00:02:35]. Bernard Nomberg flags one carve-out: X-ray films can carry a charge, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (get a quote first because a third-party vendor may be involved [_9ZPWIgPW14 @ 00:03:36].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (On the review side, Matt Francis builds one lens per litigation at Pattern Data and runs three products off it: same-day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (screening on usage, exposure timelines, diagnosis and evidentiary weight; development work on treatment patterns,) Tj ET
