BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (settlements land with 60, 90 or 120-day windows for thousands of clients [_HuCGlH6Wyw @ 00:13:03]. At Tor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (Herman Law, a NICU child's file ran 43,000 pages, where even a nurse summary at 10% would still be 4,300 pages;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (Supio filters by doctor or system and pulls weights and PT notes in real time, and across 86 depositions at seven hours) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (each, or 602 hours, it surfaces contradictions from a witness deposed seven times, plus rebuttals to comparative-fault) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (and preemption defenses [Yq68SC86WTQ @ 00:27:29]. Cara Wall's firm runs an over-20,000-case voluntary census) Tj ET
